    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "Yes, your opponent loses 1 memory.",
        "question": "If this card’s [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect activates on an opponent's Digimon with 3000 DP or less, then its DP is reduced to 0 and it's deleted, does the \"[On Deletion] Lose 1 memory\" effect given to my opponent's Digimon at the same time cause my opponent to lose 1 memory?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, they activate.  This card's \"This Digimon gains all effects of cards with [Gammamon] in this Digimon's digivolution cards\" effect is an [All Turns] effect, so it will activate as soon as the digivolution is confirmed. Therefore, [When Evolving] effects are gained and will trigger.",
        "question": "When digivolving into this card, do the [When Digivolving] effects on digivolution cards with [Gammamon] activate?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, if the memory gauge is now at 1 or greater on your opponent's side, you can activate ＜Blitz＞ .",
        "question": "I digivolve a Digimon with [Gammamon] and a [When Digivolving] ＜Blitz＞ effect into this card. Can I activate the [When Digivolving] ＜Blitz＞ effect through this card's [All Turns] effect and attack?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "No, this card's [All Turns] effect and inherited effect don't affect the inherited effects of digivolution cards with [Gammamon].",
        "question": "Does this card's [All Turns] effect and inherited effect allow me to activate the inherited effect of a digivolution card with [Gammamon] as an effect of this card?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
